<p><strong>Disclosure:</strong> this guide is published by the maker of Cortisol+. It compares official documentation checked September 16, 2026. It is not a hands-on ranking, an independent review or a clinical accuracy study.</p>
<h2>Which Apple Watch stress app should you consider?</h2>
<p>Start with what you want to understand: momentary HRV, a day of stress readings, or the relationship between sleep and recovery. No universal score or “best” app follows from having more sensors. The explanation, missing-data handling and fit with your routine matter.</p>
